[10.816, "o", "\u001b[38;5;215m●\u001b[0m The SSD needs a volume, a shared folder, then a careful data migration that\r\n"]
[11.316, "o", "  preserves ownership — Postgres and Mongo data live on those shares.\r\n"]
[11.916, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;244m└─ claude-in-chrome(screenshot)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.436, "o", "\u001b[38;5;215m●\u001b[0m The QTS session has expired — the NAS rebooted during the swap, and it's\r\n"]
[13.936, "o", "  now at the login prompt asking for the admin password.\r\n"]
[14.436, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.716, "o", "\u001b[38;5;203m\u001b[1m■ I can't type a password into a login form. That's a hard limit.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.616, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.896, "o", "\u001b[38;5;244m  Waiting for you to sign in at https://nas.example.com …\u001b[0m\r\n"]
